{"id":404101402,"chapter_id":50085,"scene_id":58505,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"战斗永无尽头。一波波怪物如潮水般从各个岔路涌出，嘶吼着扑来。","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"该死，敌人太多了……","voice":["vo_event_404101402_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"狂厄在翻涌，赫罗熟悉这种令人犯呕的感觉。","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"<i><color=#7683a2>这难道是……！</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_404101402_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"一股寒意瞬间从脊椎窜至头顶。一个她最不愿相信、却又无法忽视的可怕猜想划过脑海，她必须验证。","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"她将全身力量灌注于双臂，刀斧狠狠下劈！在飞溅的污血与碎肉中，她终于捕捉到狂厄的来源，那是——","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"？！","voice":["vo_event_404101402_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"来不及细看，赫罗堪堪避开一道攻击。一把刀深深钉入地面，没有炼金兽会用这样的武器。有人混在兽群中偷袭了赫罗。","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"谁？！","voice":["vo_event_404101402_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"兽潮汹涌，她分不清攻击的来源。偷袭者在兽潮中游走，几乎每次攻击都能给军团人身上增添一道新的伤痕。","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"海拉","content":"*文明费沙*的……不是，这帮狗崽子是闻味儿来的吗？怎么还越来越多了？！","voice":["vo_event_404101402_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"海拉狼狈地格开一只小型秘金兽的扑咬，踉跄后退，正好撞上赫罗的后背。","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"海拉","content":"赫罗！接下来该怎么办？","voice":["vo_event_404101402_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"不管怎么样——手先别停下！","voice":["vo_event_404101402_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"这些怪物身上有<color=#fb9259>地底刻印</color>！遗产，秘金研发的断点跃进，还有能够替代禁闭者的“秘金战士”——","voice":["vo_event_404101402_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"该死的，他们想要造黑环？！","voice":["vo_event_404101402_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"海拉","content":"什么？！我*，但——","voice":["vo_event_404101402_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"——受骸者会是谁？！","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"海拉脑海中瞬间闪过了某个金发的身影。","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"海拉","content":"不会吧——！？","voice":["vo_event_404101402_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"海拉！坎贝尔给的通讯器呢？！","voice":["vo_event_404101402_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"海拉手忙脚乱地从身上掏出那只特殊的通讯器，但回应她的只有忙音。","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"海拉","content":"不行，联系不上，这里一定有屏蔽，信号传不出去！","voice":["vo_event_404101402_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"海拉","content":"——啊！","voice":["vo_event_404101402_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"content":"就在她分神的瞬间，阴影中猛地冲出一只恶兽。海拉被撞了个踉跄，失去平衡跌入旁侧的兽群之中。","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"？！快，手给我！","voice":["vo_event_404101402_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"content":"在兽潮的缝隙中，海拉看到了赫罗伸出的手，她忍着剧痛，奋力将自己的手臂伸向对方。只差一点，马上就能够到——","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"content":"锵！又一道攻击斩来。海拉的动作迟疑了半秒，就在这短暂的迟滞间——","style":3,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"海拉——？！","voice":["vo_event_404101402_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_41014","style":1,"background":2391,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"content":"兽潮将两人瞬间冲散，卷入不同的黑暗岔路之中。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}